# Serving probe.html to a phone over https needs a local certificate and a Caddyfile in the
# experiment directory (see experiments/external-dictionaries/README.md). Neither belongs in a
# public repository — the Caddyfile carries a LAN address and the key is a private key.
Caddyfile
*.pem
*-key.pem
